<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Publicar jogo — BlockWorld</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#0b1020;--panel:#131b30;--line:#293650;--text:#edf2ff;--muted:#9aa8c5;--accent:#8175ff}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 0,#24245b 0,transparent 35%),var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:15px/1.5 system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif}main{width:min(820px,calc(100% - 32px));margin:42px auto}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px}.logo{font-weight:900;font-size:22px}.panel{margin-top:22px;background:#121a2ceF;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:24px;box-shadow:0 18px 60px #0003}h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,42px);line-height:1.1;margin:22px 0 10px}p{color:var(--muted)}label{display:block;font-weight:650;margin:16px 0 7px}input,textarea,select{width:100%;background:#0b1223;color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;font:inherit}textarea{min-height:100px;resize:vertical}button,.button{background:var(--accent);color:white;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;font:inherit;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:wait}.mutedbtn{background:#202b43}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.status{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:#0b1223;color:#b9c6e2;white-space:pre-wrap;margin-top:16px}.help{font-size:13px}.hidden{display:none}@media(max-width:600px){.row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.panel{padding:17px}}
</style></head><body><main>
<div class="top"><a class="logo" href="/" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none">◈ BlockWorld</a><a class="button mutedbtn" href="/">Voltar à plataforma</a></div>
<h1>Publique seu jogo.</h1><p>Envie uma cena JSON exportada da BlockWorld Engine e transforme-a em um jogo que abre no navegador.</p>
<section class="panel"><div id="account">Verificando sua conta...</div>
<form id="publishForm" class="hidden">
<label for="title">Nome do jogo</label><input id="title" maxlength="60" minlength="2" required placeholder="Meu primeiro mundo">
<label for="description">Descrição</label><textarea id="description" maxlength="500" minlength="5" required placeholder="Conte aos jogadores o que eles vão encontrar..."></textarea>
<div class="row"><div><label for="category">Categoria</label><select id="category"><option>Aventura</option><option>Construção</option><option>Corrida</option><option>Obby</option><option>Simulação</option><option>Outro</option></select></div><div><label for="sceneFile">Arquivo de cena (.json)</label><input id="sceneFile" type="file" accept="application/json,.json" required></div></div>
<p class="help">A versão atual aceita cenas com até 500 objetos básicos (cubos, esferas, planos e cilindros). Não envie executáveis, scripts ou arquivos privados.</p>
<button id="publishButton" type="submit">Publicar jogo</button>
</form><div id="status" class="status" role="status">Carregando...</div></section>
</main><script src="/publish.js" defer></script></body></html>
